{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/d30a81dc05d6aeb5e98e63bb5ccffef4.avif?t=1767803781\" width=1256 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to Puppy Park!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nestled in a peaceful countryside setting, Puppy Park invites you to run your very own tiny dog hotel. Spend 20\u201330 minutes each day caring for adorable pups of all breeds and personalities, building bonds and growing your reputation one wagging tail at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/da42916cd8b3b54005bf8c6007973b83.poster.avif?t=1767803781\" width=1152 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/da42916cd8b3b54005bf8c6007973b83.webm?t=1767803781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Daily Care &amp; Connection</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every day, new dogs arrive with their unique natures and needs. Your job is to welcome them warmly \u2014 shop for the perfect food and treats, pamper them with grooming, and take them on walks along scenic routes tailored just for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/bb2c91fb9baa35dc893102868439cc0e.poster.avif?t=1767803781\" width=1028 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/bb2c91fb9baa35dc893102868439cc0e.webm?t=1767803781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grow Your Hotel &amp; Reputation</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As word gets around about your excellent care facilities, your reputation will grow! Use this to unlock new items, expand your capabilities, and discover new walking routes to keep things fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/1e05c3c10eacc3111d56aa17860124d9.poster.avif?t=1767803781\" width=1029 height=609 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/1e05c3c10eacc3111d56aa17860124d9.webm?t=1767803781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Relax and Enjoy the Simple Life</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Designed for cozy, bite-sized daily play sessions, Puppy Park offers a soothing rhythm of care and connection. Watch your hotel fill with happy dogs, joyful barks, and wagging tails \u2014 a perfect little escape from the hustle and bustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What Puppy Park offers:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a charming dog hotel with pups of all breeds and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in daily care loops: feeding, grooming, walking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new items and scenic walking routes as you grow your reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with a slow-paced, real-time gameplay rhythm designed for short daily sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy peaceful countryside vibes and a cozy, heartwarming atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What Puppy Park does NOT offer:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced or hardcore gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long play times (1hr+ per day)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer or competitive modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex hotel management and skill trees</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819600?t=1767803781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/a2978cc814e7622c676f3b9c865cb2c4611374b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767803781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/b202af53a72a083c45aad9fead27c25adc02bdfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767803781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/b202af53a72a083c45aad9fead27c25adc02bdfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767803781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819600/extras/d30a81dc05d6aeb5e98e63bb5ccffef4.avif?t=1767803781\" width=1256 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to Puppy Park!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nestled in a peaceful countryside setting, Puppy Park invites you to run your very own tiny dog